//
// Copy next to the outbound gateway for ONE producer
// (internal/adapters/outbound/<producer>/), substitute the producer's names,
// and fill in the call sites / fixtures / DTOs marked SEARCH-FOR. Compilable
// in spirit: every archetype is complete except for the repo-specific tables.
// Test-only dependency: github.com/getkin/kin-openapi (keep it out of the
// production import graph). The pinned copy lives at
// testdata/<producer>.openapi.yaml and is listed in contracts/pinned.json.
// Fleet standard: docs/contract-testing.md (warehouse-harness-template).
package {{PRODUCER}}_test

